</nav>
<main class="main" id="main" tabindex="-1">
<div id="menu" class="menu"></div>
<div class="crumb" id="crumbT"><button type="button" class="cb-back">‹ <span data-t="Back to menu"></span></button><button type="button" class="cb-next"></button></div>
<section class="sec" id="s-go">
<header class="sec-head"><h2>Where to tonight?</h2></header>
<button type="button" class="instbtn" id="instBtn"><span aria-hidden="true">📲</span> Install the app</button>
<p class="insthelp" id="helpIos" hidden>On iPhone: tap Share, then Add to Home Screen.</p><p class="insthelp" id="helpAnd" hidden>On Android: open the browser menu, then tap Install app or Add to Home screen.</p>
<div class="gotabs" role="group" aria-label="Where to go"><button type="button" data-g="hh"><span class="gl"><span aria-hidden="true">🍹</span> Happy hour</span></button><button type="button" data-g="cl"><span class="gl"><span aria-hidden="true">🪩</span> Clubs</span></button><button type="button" data-g="fd"><span class="gl"><span aria-hidden="true">🍕</span> Late food</span></button></div>
<p class="go-head" id="goHead" role="status"></p>
<div class="golist" id="goList"></div>
<p class="cap" id="goNote"></p>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-weekend">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Plan your night <span class="tag t-m">Modelled</span></p>
<h2>What will your night out cost?</h2>
<p>Tell us how you go out, see what you will spend, then see what you could keep.</p>
</header>
<div class="pn">
<div class="pn-in">
<div class="pn-card">
<div class="pn-head"><div><h3>Plan your night</h3><p>Adjust your drinks to see live savings</p></div><div class="pn-seg" id="plKind"></div></div>
<div class="pn-box">
<div class="pn-bl"><span id="plLbl"></span><em>Per person</em></div>
<div class="pn-step"><button type="button" class="pn-m" id="plMinus" aria-label="−">−</button><div class="pn-num"><b id="plN"></b><span id="plUnit"></span></div><button type="button" class="pn-p" id="plPlus" aria-label="+">+</button></div>
<div class="pn-q" id="plQ"></div>
</div>
<div class="pn-row" id="plClubRow"><div><b>Ending at a club?</b><span class="pn-badge">Bar + Club</span><small id="plClubS"></small></div><button type="button" class="pn-sw" id="plClub" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Ending at a club?"></button></div>
<div class="pn-row"><div><b>Late-night snack</b><span class="pn-badge">Snack</span><small id="plSnS"></small></div><button type="button" class="pn-sw" id="plSn" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Late-night snack"></button></div>
<div class="pn-row"><div><b>Nights out per week</b></div><div class="chips" id="plNights"></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="pn-out">
<div class="pn-res">
<div class="pn-two">
<div class="pn-tile"><span>Total tonight</span><b id="plTot"></b><small id="plSub"></small></div>
<div class="pn-tile sv"><span>You save <i class="pn-badge g" id="plP"></i></span><b id="plK"></b><small>Kept in your pocket</small></div>
</div>
<div class="pn-bars">
<div class="pn-bl2"><span><i class="d bad"></i>Without a plan</span><b class="bad" id="plA"></b></div>
<div class="br-t"><i class="hot" id="plAb"></i></div>
<div class="br-t"><i class="good" id="plBb"></i></div>
<div class="pn-bl2"><span><i class="d good"></i>With a plan</span><b class="good" id="plB"></b></div>
</div>
</div>
<details class="pn-det" open><summary><span><b>How it breaks down</b><small>Itemized prices: no plan vs with plan</small></span></summary>
<div class="tw"><table class="pn-tbl"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>No plan</th><th>Plan</th></tr></thead><tbody id="plTb"></tbody></table></div></details>
<details class="pn-det"><summary><span><b>How we calculate this</b></span></summary><div class="pn-calc"><p id="plE"></p><p id="plT"></p></div></details>
<div class="pn-foot">✨ <span id="plY"></span></div>
<div class="pl-cta"><a class="btn alt" href="#s-happy">Happy hour</a><a class="btn alt" href="#s-clubs">Clubs</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-nights">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Night types <span class="tag t-m">Modelled</span></p>
<h2>One night, six ways to spend it</h2>
<p>Each night is built from the unit prices on this page. The assumptions sit under every bar, so you can check the arithmetic.</p>
</header>
<div class="g21">
<div class="card">
<h3>Cost per person for one night</h3>
<div class="legend"><span><i class="sg-d"></i>Drinks</span><span><i class="sg-f"></i>Food</span><span><i class="sg-c"></i>Cover</span></div>
<div id="nightStack"></div>
<div class="field" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="tip">Rounded-up tip on food and drinks <output id="o-tip"></output></label><input id="tip" type="range" min="0" max="15" step="1" value="0"></div>
</div>
<div class="stack">
<div class="card"><h3>Per year</h3><div class="tw"><table id="nightTbl"></table></div></div>
<div class="note-box" id="rvc"></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-overview">
<div class="hero-grid">
<div class="hero-copy">
<p class="eyebrow">Prague · drinks &amp; nightlife economics</p>
<h1>What does a night out really cost?</h1>
<p class="lead">A half litre of beer costs 40 Kč on a Žižkov corner and 160 Kč on an Old Town Square terrace. This page prices the whole night, from the first pint to the club cover, and turns it into a yearly figure you can change.</p>
<div class="kpis" id="kpis"></div>
</div>
<div class="card profile" id="profile">
<div class="profile-top">
<div id="coaster"></div>
<div><b id="tabTitle"></b><p id="tabSub"></p></div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="chips-label">Preset</p>
<div class="chips" id="presets"></div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="chips-label">Drink</p>
<div class="chips" id="drinkChips"></div>
</div>
<div class="field"><label for="i-d">Drinks per night <output id="o-d"></output></label><input id="i-d" type="range" min="1" max="12" value="4"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="i-p">Price per drink <output id="o-p"></output></label><input id="i-p" type="range" min="30" max="400" step="5" value="120"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="i-w">Nights per week <output id="o-w"></output></label><input id="i-w" type="range" min="0" max="7" value="2"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="i-o">Other spending per night, in Kč (cover, food, taxi)</label><input id="i-o" type="number" min="0" step="10" value="0" inputmode="numeric"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="findings">
<p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:16px">Four numbers worth knowing</p>
<div class="g4" id="findings"></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-prices">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Drink prices <span class="tag t-u">Your data</span></p>
<h2>What one drink costs</h2>
<p>Beer sits at the bottom of the scale and a premium cocktail at the top. The table shows what each choice adds up to if every drink of your night were that one.</p>
</header>
<div class="g21">
<div class="card"><h3>Price range per drink</h3><div id="priceRange"></div><p class="cap">The marker shows the average. The shaded bar runs from the low to the high price.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>What each drink adds up to</h3><div class="tw"><table id="priceTbl"></table></div></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-areas">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Areas <span class="tag t-s">Sourced</span></p>
<h2>The same beer, a different street</h2>
<p>Price of a 0.5 l draught lager in 2026. Pubs outside the centre charge about half what the tourist terraces charge for the same pour.</p>
</header>
<div class="card am-card"><h3>Beers by Neighborhood</h3>
<div class="am-stats" id="amStats"></div>
<div class="am-tabs" id="amTabs" role="group" aria-label="Map type"><button type="button" data-am="price">Price map</button><button type="button" data-am="live">Google map</button></div>
<div id="areaMap"></div>
<div id="amLive" hidden></div>
<div class="am-detail" id="amDetail" aria-live="polite"></div>
<div class="am-leg" id="amLeg"></div>
<p class="cap" id="amCap">Positions follow the real geography. Bigger and darker means a dearer half litre. Tap an area for details.</p><p class="maps big" id="mapAll"></p><p class="maps big" id="mapOpen"></p></div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-cocktails">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Cocktails and wine <span class="tag t-s">Sourced</span></p>
<h2>Where the bill grows</h2>
<p>A cocktail costs between 120 and 350 Kč depending on the room. Happy hours are the one place where the price drops sharply.</p>
</header>
<div class="g2">
<div class="stack">
<div class="card"><h3>Cocktails by bar type</h3><div id="cockRange"></div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Cocktail bars, price per drink</h3><div id="barRange"></div><p class="cap">Prices as quoted by EuropeNightlife for each bar. Menus change, so check before you order.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Wine bar and pub extras</h3><div class="tw"><table id="extraTbl"></table></div></div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>What happy hour saves you</h3>
<div class="field"><label for="hhT">Drink</label>
<select id="hhT"><option value="beer">Beer, 65 Kč normal vs 40 Kč happy hour</option><option value="cocktail">Cocktail, 260 Kč craft bar vs 135 Kč happy hour</option></select></div>
<div class="field" style="margin-top:14px"><label for="hhN">Drinks per night at happy hour <output id="o-hh"></output></label><input id="hhN" type="range" min="0" max="6" value="2"></div>
<div class="kvs" style="margin-top:20px" id="hhOut"></div>
<p class="cap">Uses your nights per week from the Overview panel. Happy hour prices come from Prague bar guides and run on weekday afternoons.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-happy">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Happy hours <span class="tag t-s">Sourced</span></p>
<h2>When to arrive for cheaper drinks</h2>
<p>Prague venues with their happy hour days, times and deals. Every entry shows how well its times are confirmed. Pick a day, or switch on Happening now to see what is running in Prague at this moment.</p>
</header>
<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px"><h3>Happy hours, Monday to Sunday</h3><p class="hh-now" id="hhNowLine" role="status"></p><div class="tw"><table class="wk" id="hhWeek"></table></div><p class="cap">Times as listed. Today is highlighted. A window that runs past midnight counts for the day it starts.</p></div>
<div class="g21">
<div class="card">
<h3>Pick a day</h3>
<div class="hh-ctl">
<div class="days" id="hhDays"></div>
<label class="opt" for="hhNow"><input type="checkbox" id="hhNow">Happening now in Prague</label>
<label class="opt" for="hhConf"><input type="checkbox" id="hhConf">Only times confirmed on the venue's own site</label>
</div>
<p class="hh-sum" id="hhSum"></p>
<h3 style="margin-top:24px">Places with a happy hour, by hour</h3>
<div id="hhChart"></div>
</div>
<div class="stack">
<div class="card"><div class="kvs" id="hhStats"></div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Cocktail prices quoted</h3><div id="hhLadder"></div><p class="cap">Lowest cocktail price quoted at each venue, against the normal craft bar price.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="card" style="margin-top:16px"><h3 id="hhListTitle"></h3><div id="hhList"></div><p class="maps big" id="hhMapsDay"></p></div>
<div class="g2" style="margin-top:16px">
<div class="card"><h3>Listed without full times</h3><ul class="gaps" id="hhInc"></ul></div>
<div class="card"><h3>How the times were checked</h3>
<div class="legend-list">
<div><span class="badge b-venue">Venue site</span><span>The venue's own website states the days and times.</span></div>
<div><span class="badge b-guide">Local guide</span><span>A Prague guide published the times, and its pages agree. The venue's own site was not checked.</span></div>
<div><span class="badge b-listing">Listing only</span><span>One event listing, with no second source.</span></div>
<div><span class="badge b-conflict">Sources differ</span><span>Sources disagree on the days, times or price. Check before you go.</span></div>
</div>
<p class="cap">I read every page on 9 November 2026. Nobody phoned the venues or visited them, and happy hours change often. A Bombay Express offer that ended on 31 December 2025, shisha and tea-room deals, and a sushi roll discount were left out.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p class="cap" style="margin-top:16px">Opening status was checked on 10 November 2026 against Firmy.cz and venue sites. Two venues listed as no longer active were removed. Other places may have closed since.</p>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-food">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Late-night food <span class="tag t-s">Sourced</span></p>
<h2>Hungry after midnight?</h2>
<p>Places that serve food late or all night, with a typical price. Open or closed follows Prague time.</p>
</header>
<div class="card">
<div class="chips" id="fdTabs" style="margin-bottom:14px"></div>
<div class="golist" id="fdList"></div>
<p class="cap" id="fdNote" style="margin-top:12px"></p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-clubs">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Clubs <span class="tag t-s">Sourced</span></p>
<h2>Paying to get in</h2>
<p>Cover charges run from free to 300 Kč for ordinary nights. Concerts and special events can cost more than that.</p>
</header>
<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px"><h3>Club guide</h3><div class="golist" id="clubGuide"></div><p class="cap">Check the club page for tonight's cover and hours before you go.</p></div>
<div class="g2">
<div class="card"><h3>Club entrance fees</h3><div id="clubRange"></div></div>
<div class="card">
<h3>What cover adds up to</h3>
<div class="field"><label for="clubSel">Club</label><select id="clubSel"></select></div>
<div class="field" style="margin-top:14px"><label for="clubM">Club nights per month <output id="o-cm"></output></label><input id="clubM" type="range" min="0" max="12" value="2"></div>
<div class="kvs" style="margin-top:20px" id="clubOut"></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-trend">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Price trend <span class="tag t-s">Sourced</span></p>
<h2>Beer got 40% dearer in three years</h2>
<p>Average price of a draught half litre in Prague restaurants, from cash register data. I found no comparable average for 2025, so the line stops at 2024.</p>
</header>
<div class="g21">
<div class="card"><h3>Prague draught beer price</h3><div class="chart" id="trendChart"></div>
<p class="cap">The hollow marker is a crowd-sourced Numbeo figure from October 2026. It uses a different method, so it is not joined to the line.</p></div>
<div class="stack">
<div class="card"><div class="kvs" id="trendStats"></div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Year on year</h3><div class="tw"><table id="trendTbl"></table></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
<h3>What pushed prices up</h3>
<ul class="timeline">
<li><time>Oct 2021</time><span>Plzeňský Prazdroj raised draught prices for the first time since 2018, by about 3% on average.</span></li>
<li><time>2022–23</time><span>Energy and operating costs led bars to add 5 to 10 Kč per half litre, more than the breweries themselves did.</span></li>
<li><time>Jan 2024</time><span>VAT on draught beer moved from 10% to 21%. Prague restaurants added 3 to 4 Kč per pint, and 62% of surveyed pubs raised prices.</span></li>
<li><time>1 Oct 2026</time><span>Pilsner Urquell's maker announced a 2.6% rise on draught and bottled beer, its first since 2023.</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-projection">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Projection <span class="tag t-m">Modelled</span></p>
<h2>Your tab over the next ten years</h2>
<p>Spending rises with price inflation. The second line shows what the same money would be worth if you invested it at the end of each year instead. Both rates are assumptions you can change. This is an illustration and not financial advice.</p>
</header>
<div class="g21">
<div class="card"><h3>Cumulative spend</h3><div class="chart" id="projChart"></div></div>
<div class="stack">
<div class="card">
<div class="field"><label for="pY">Years <output id="o-pY"></output></label><input id="pY" type="range" min="1" max="10" value="10"></div>
<div class="field" style="margin-top:14px"><label for="pI">Price inflation per year <output id="o-pI"></output></label><input id="pI" type="range" min="0" max="8" step="0.1" value="2.2"></div>
<div class="field" style="margin-top:14px"><label for="pR">Investment return per year <output id="o-pR"></output></label><input id="pR" type="range" min="0" max="10" step="0.5" value="4"></div>
<p class="cap">The 2.2% default is an assumption, not a forecast.</p>
</div>
<div class="card"><div class="kvs" id="projOut"></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="sec" id="s-sources">
<header class="sec-head">
<p class="eyebrow">Sources and gaps</p>
<h2>Where the numbers come from</h2>
<p>“Sourced” figures are ranges quoted by the pages below, and they differ between guides. “Modelled” figures are my calculations from those unit prices. “Your data” comes from the tables you supplied.</p>
</header>
<div class="g2">
<div class="stack">
<div class="card"><h3>Not found</h3>
<ul class="gaps">
<li>Monthly spending by age group. Only survey data on which days each age group drinks exists.</li>
<li>Spending by tourists compared with residents.</li>
<li>A 2025 or 2026 average beer price from cash register data.</li>
<li>A per-person nightly spend figure for Prague. The Night types section is modelled.</li>
<li>Happy hour times confirmed by phone or in person. Several venues state their times on their own site, and some of those disagree with a listing. Most others rest on a single listing.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="card"><h3>Sources</h3>
<ol class="src">
